# Always push to Vercel

When finishing website changes for this project:

1. Commit the relevant changes (never commit `.env`, `.env.local`, or secrets).
2. Push to `origin` (`git push`).
3. Confirm the Vercel production deploy succeeds (GitHub integration usually auto-deploys on push to `main`).
4. If auto-deploy is not linked, run `vercel --prod` (or `npx vercel --prod`) and report the live URL.

Do this by default after meaningful site updates unless the user says not to deploy.
